674
00:37:52.042 --> 00:37:54.250
Ignorance is bliss, sis.

675
00:37:54.833 --> 00:37:55.833
Point.

676
00:37:57.208 --> 00:37:58.208
So…

677
00:37:59.708 --> 00:38:01.208
