There are 280 passengers on it.

1002
00:56:24.333 --> 00:56:26.375
Including women, children,
and senior citizens.

1003
00:56:26.750 --> 00:56:29.167
- Sir, Ms. Mala got a tip.
- Okay, fine.

1004
00:56:29.833 --> 00:56:30.833
What is your opinion?

1005
00:56:32.500 --> 00:56:34.625
Although no one can be
trusted nowadays, but…

1006
00:56:35.333 --> 00:56:36.542
I can vouch for this girl.

1007
00:56:37.083 --> 00:56:38.333
She can't be a criminal.

1008
00:56:38.750 --> 00:56:40.667
Sir, we checked everywhere.

1009
00:56:41.000 --> 00:56:42.750
Dustbins. Seats. Toilets.

1010
00:56:42.833 --> 00:56:43.833
But we found nothing.

1011
00:56:44.083 --> 00:56:45.083
Hey, wait.

1012
00:56:46.333 --> 00:56:47.792
- Yes?
- Garbage?

1013
00:56:51.708 --> 00:56:52.833
What? Take it out.

1014
00:57:02.250 --> 00:57:03.250
Wow!

1015
00:57:04.333 --> 00:57:06.083
Looks like you really love chocolates.

1016
00:57:09.708 --> 00:57:13.167
Can't stay hidden for too long.

1017
00:57:14.542 --> 00:57:17.458
The truth will be revealed soon.

1018
00:57:21.750 --> 00:57:22.750
Want one?

1019
00:57:23.750 --> 00:57:24.750
No.

1020
00:57:24.875 --> 00:57:25.875
No?

1021
00:57:27.417 --> 00:57:28.542
Fine. I'll have it.

1022
00:58:01.583 --> 00:58:02.667
You grab some as well.

1023
00:58:08.458 --> 00:58:09.458
Pistachio.

1024
00:58:10.417 --> 00:58:11.625
Just eat.

1025
00:58:13.583 --> 00:58:14.875
Can we go home now?

1026
00:58:15.500 --> 00:58:16.542
Enough with your nonsense!

1027
00:58:16.792 --> 00:58:17.792
Where is the gold?

1028
00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:19.000
Where is the gold?!

1029
00:58:22.375 --> 00:58:24.042
Enough, Cleopatra.

1030
00:58:24.125 --> 00:58:26.750
It's just make-up, not a time machine.

1031
00:58:33.667 --> 00:58:34.667
Yes, Captain.

1032
00:58:39.083 --> 00:58:40.083
Okay.

1033
00:58:41.458 --> 00:58:42.458
Shit.

1034
00:58:42.750 --> 00:58:43.583
What do you mean?

1035
00:58:43.667 --> 00:58:48.375
He said something about checking.
Something about a tip they got.

1036
00:58:49.250 --> 00:58:50.250
Sir.

1037
00:58:50.375 --> 00:58:51.875
Please be seated, sir.

1038
00:58:51.958 --> 00:58:54.333
What tip?
Tell me exactly what he said.

1039
00:58:54.417 --> 00:58:55.750
No time for details.

1040
00:58:55.833 --> 00:58:57.333
Sir, please be seated.

1041
00:58:58.958 --> 00:59:01.250
Something about an arrest.

1042
00:59:01.583 --> 00:59:02.583
Arrest?

1043
00:59:04.417 --> 00:59:05.625
Sit down, you moron!

1044
00:59:09.667 --> 00:59:11.708
Captain Divya, what do we do now?

1045
00:59:12.208 --> 00:59:13.333
No one will check here.

1046
00:59:13.917 --> 00:59:14.917
Oh, God!

1047
00:59:15.375 --> 00:59:17.417
Mittal's gonna brawl like a baby.

1048
00:59:17.667 --> 00:59:19.267
Divya, are you sure this is a good idea?

1049
00:59:19.333 --> 00:59:21.374
Why don't you open the damn window
and chuck it out?

1050
00:59:23.500 --> 00:59:25.500
Where is the gold?
Where did you hide it?

1051
00:59:25.583 --> 00:59:27.792
Where did you hide it?

1052
00:59:27.875 --> 00:59:28.875
Where is the gold?!

1053
00:59:29.042 --> 00:59:31.375
Where did you hide it?

1054
00:59:31.458 --> 00:59:33.083
Where is the gold?

1055
00:59:33.167 --> 00:59:34.375
Where is the gold?

1056
00:59:34.583 --> 00:59:35.917
Where is the gold?

1057
00:59:37.375 --> 00:59:38.375
Mala!

1058
00:59:40.625 --> 00:59:41.500
Let them go.

1059
00:59:41.583 --> 00:59:43.809
- The tip was probably wrong.
- The tip wasn't wrong, sir.

1060
00:59:43.833 --> 00:59:45.268
The information came from an insider.

1061
00:59:45.292 --> 00:59:47.167
The informer was an air hostess like them.

1062
00:59:47.250 --> 00:59:49.500
- And she knew all four of them...
- Mala.

1063
00:59:50.417 --> 00:59:51.792
That's an order!

1064
00:59:54.375 --> 00:59:55.375
Let's go.

1065
01:00:06.417 --> 01:00:07.497
Where the hell is the gold?

1066
01:00:09.375 --> 01:00:10.417
<i>Look!</i>

1067
01:00:12.042 --> 01:00:13.042
The gold is gone.

1068
01:00:13.958 --> 01:00:15.917
The gold is gone.

1069
01:00:25.292 --> 01:00:27.792
I knew that champagne would come back
to bite us one day.

1070
01:00:29.917 --> 01:00:31.667
She went and posted pics
of a bloody BMW!

1071
01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:33.470
And you're all stressed out
about champagne.

1072
01:00:35.792 --> 01:00:39.250
Your phony life is gonna screw up
our actual lives.

1073
01:00:40.958 --> 01:00:43.125
I'm going to rip that snitch Komal
a new one.

1074
01:00:44.167 --> 01:00:45.167
Jazz, don't do it.

1075
01:00:45.708 --> 01:00:46.708
Jazz, don't.

1076
01:00:46.833 --> 01:00:48.125
Jasmine, just stop it!

1077
01:00:48.458 --> 01:00:49.667
It's not Komal's fault.

1078
01:00:50.167 --> 01:00:52.625
Weren't we livid with those
Rajvanshi-Mittal kinds of crooks?

1079
01:00:53.292 --> 01:00:55.000
Please, Rajvanshi deserves an award.

1080
01:00:55.083 --> 01:00:56.917
Right now, we're no different from them.

1081
01:00:57.542 --> 01:00:58.542
You're right,

1082
01:00:58.667 --> 01:01:00.987
but your principles ain't putting food
on the table, ma'am.

1083
01:01:01.667 --> 01:01:02.833
Wow, Sethi ma'am,

1084
01:01:03.333 --> 01:01:05.453
so I guess everyone should turn
into criminals, right?

1085
01:01:07.417 --> 01:01:08.417
I'm sorry,

1086
01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:10.542
but nobody made you do this.

1087
01:01:11.167 --> 01:01:14.000
And you've been lying to your family
long before you even met us.

1088
01:01:14.542 --> 01:01:15.542
So, please,

1089
01:01:15.625 --> 01:01:17.958
go play the innocent act somewhere else!

1090
01:01:18.167 --> 01:01:19.247
I used to be a top student.

1091
01:01:19.667 --> 01:01:21.684
Actually, someone like you who didn't
even finish high school won't understand.

1092
01:01:21.708 --> 01:01:23.250
Let it be. Just stop it.

1093
01:01:23.333 --> 01:01:24.833
What won't I understand?

1094
01:01:25.208 --> 01:01:26.529
What won't I freaking understand?

1095
01:01:26.833 --> 01:01:28.351
That even though you were
at the top of your class,

1096
01:01:28.375 --> 01:01:29.896
you're on the same level as a dropout?

1097
01:01:30.583 --> 01:01:33.375
I managed to get the same job as you,
"Captain Divya."

1098
01:01:34.083 --> 01:01:35.542
Without being a burden on my family.

1099
01:01:35.792 --> 01:01:36.625
Enough.

1100
01:01:36.708 --> 01:01:38.083
- Up your mother's…
- Enough. Stop…

1101
01:01:38.167 --> 01:01:40.059
- Stop! Cut it out, guys.
- Too late, she's dead!

1102
01:01:40.083 --> 01:01:41.143
Why don't you join her then?

1103
01:01:41.167 --> 01:01:42.250
Cut it out, guys! Stop it!

1104
01:01:42.333 --> 01:01:44.453
I told you to cut it out!
Come on, guys, knock it off!

1105
01:01:46.167 --> 01:01:48.667
Hey, can you just pull over real quick?

1106
01:01:51.958 --> 01:01:53.417
Get out!

1107
01:02:34.958 --> 01:02:35.958
Why not, though?

1108
01:02:36.042 --> 01:02:37.562
Rajvanshi was doing it as well, right?

1109
01:02:37.958 --> 01:02:38.958
Yeah, but…

1110
01:02:39.042 --> 01:02:41.042
I can't say anything about Jasmine,

1111
01:02:41.583 --> 01:02:44.375
but Sethi ma'am, and Divya…

1112
01:02:44.583 --> 01:02:46.708
I heard they were grilled
for four straight hours...

1113
01:02:54.417 --> 01:02:57.125
Life's long, my dear.

1114
01:02:58.292 --> 01:03:00.892
You should always have someone
in your life you can call your own.

1115
01:03:03.917 --> 01:03:07.542
Grandpa, the less I'm connected to people,

1116
01:03:08.708 --> 01:03:11.167
the less heartbreak
I have to deal with later.

1117
01:03:17.792 --> 01:03:18.792
Punnu?

1118
01:03:19.083 --> 01:03:20.083
What the hell?!

1119
01:03:20.250 --> 01:03:21.250
Hi.

1120
01:03:24.500 --> 01:03:26.583
Maybe you should work at a liquor store,

1121
01:03:26.958 --> 01:03:28.558
at least, that's one job you won't quit.

1122
01:03:29.375 --> 01:03:31.615
Where's Sapna?
I haven't been able to reach her for days.

1123
01:03:32.083 --> 01:03:33.083
Sold her.

1124
01:03:33.417 --> 01:03:34.292
What?!

1125
01:03:34.375 --> 01:03:37.458
Come on! She got a gig at a hotel
in the Middle East.

1126
01:03:37.542 --> 01:03:39.458
She left.

1127
01:03:40.750 --> 01:03:42.270
I'll get the first aid kit. Stay here.

1128
01:03:50.542 --> 01:03:52.333
Punnu? What are you doing?

1129
01:03:52.875 --> 01:03:55.458
- Well, I just need some…
- Cash?

1130
01:03:58.083 --> 01:03:59.708
I didn't ask you for any.

1131
01:04:00.583 --> 01:04:02.125
You don't make much anyway.

1132
01:04:02.500 --> 01:04:03.500
Punnu!

1133
01:04:04.292 --> 01:04:05.292
I know everything!

1134
01:04:05.458 --> 01:04:07.375
You guys brainwashed Sapna.

1135
01:04:07.833 --> 01:04:09.333
You used to give her cash, right?

1136
01:04:09.792 --> 01:04:11.458
But you can't help out your own brother?

1137
01:04:11.625 --> 01:04:13.059
Only if the brother is worth something.

1138
01:04:13.083 --> 01:04:15.708
As if you've accomplished something great!

1139
01:04:16.125 --> 01:04:18.458
You've spent your life
on your wife's money.

1140
01:04:18.542 --> 01:04:19.958
Who are you to lecture me?

1141
01:04:20.375 --> 01:04:21.375
Geetu?

1142
01:04:21.708 --> 01:04:22.792
Get out of my face!

1143
01:04:23.458 --> 01:04:24.458
Just get out!

1144
01:04:34.667 --> 01:04:35.667
Geetu…

1145
01:04:37.000 --> 01:04:38.125
It's okay.

1146
01:04:40.542 --> 01:04:41.542
It's okay.

1147
01:05:00.208 --> 01:05:02.417
I thought it would be a quick thing.
Just two months,

1148
01:05:02.875 --> 01:05:04.167
and I'd snag a pilot gig.

1149
01:05:04.917 --> 01:05:06.277
Then everything would be all good.

1150
01:05:07.542 --> 01:05:10.542
Those two months just kept dragging,
and now it's been two years.

1151
01:05:12.833 --> 01:05:14.375
How do I tell our parents?

1152
01:05:15.792 --> 01:05:17.208
I couldn't get a job as a pilot.

1153
01:05:18.250 --> 01:05:20.450
Are you trying to give them
a heart attack or something?

1154
01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.167
If they find out that
their goody-two-shoes kid

1155
01:05:23.250 --> 01:05:24.530
turned into a freaking criminal,

1156
01:05:24.792 --> 01:05:25.792
Mom will...

1157
01:05:26.333 --> 01:05:28.000
Mom will hang herself by the temple bell.

1158
01:05:28.208 --> 01:05:30.128
- So, what the hell do I do then?
- I don't know,

1159
01:05:30.375 --> 01:05:31.750
but just shut your trap.

1160
01:05:32.875 --> 01:05:35.196
We didn't get far in life
by being honest, that's for sure.

1161
01:05:36.750 --> 01:05:37.893
Listen, no matter what goes down,

1162
01:05:37.917 --> 01:05:40.167
I know for a fact that you're gonna fly
a plane someday.

1163
01:05:41.833 --> 01:05:43.314
If not you,
then who else would do it?

1164
01:05:51.292 --> 01:05:54.042
Now, let's turn our attention
to the major development of the day.

1165
01:05:54.125 --> 01:05:55.476
Breaking news coming in from Mumbai.

1166
01:05:55.500 --> 01:05:58.958
<i>It is reported that it was raining gold
on the Moscow-bound flight</i>

1167
01:05:59.292 --> 01:06:00.750
<i>of Kohinoor Airways.</i>

1168
01:06:01.125 --> 01:06:04.875
<i>Interestingly, the gold fell from the
airplane's roof panel during turbulence.</i>

1169
01:06:04.958 --> 01:06:06.750
Do they have the internet in prisons?

1170
01:06:07.875 --> 01:06:10.917
According to sources,
around 12 kilograms of gold,

1171
01:06:11.083 --> 01:06:13.583
shaped like chocolates, was seized.

1172
01:06:13.958 --> 01:06:15.208
According to sources!

1173
01:06:15.500 --> 01:06:17.101
Has anyone ever seen
these alleged "sources"?

1174
01:06:17.125 --> 01:06:19.206
A lot of time has passed.
Who knows whose gold it is?

1175
01:06:19.833 --> 01:06:21.018
It could even belong to Rajvanshi, right?

1176
01:06:21.042 --> 01:06:24.000
<i>It's obvious that officials from the top…</i>

1177
01:06:24.083 --> 01:06:25.458
Don't feel bad, sir.

1178
01:06:28.542 --> 01:06:29.750
Your tip was right, Mala.

1179
01:06:30.250 --> 01:06:31.500
Doesn't matter, sir.

1180
01:06:32.125 --> 01:06:33.125
What can we do?

1181
01:06:34.833 --> 01:06:36.754
Those girls slipped
straight through our fingers.

1182
01:06:37.583 --> 01:06:38.583
You don't say.

1183
01:06:52.542 --> 01:06:53.601
In seven years of my career,

1184
01:06:53.625 --> 01:06:56.125
I've seen gold pour out
of every freaking place.

1185
01:06:57.583 --> 01:06:58.708
Never from the roof.

1186
01:07:00.583 --> 01:07:02.264
Finally, you put your pilot degree to use.

1187
01:07:02.875 --> 01:07:04.167
Can we talk?

1188
01:07:06.125 --> 01:07:07.125
Please.

1189
01:07:07.583 --> 01:07:08.958
You lost your chance.

1190
01:07:09.083 --> 01:07:10.833
I didn't want to involve you...

1191
01:07:11.333 --> 01:07:12.333
Let it be.

1192
01:07:17.958 --> 01:07:19.039
What happened to that girl,

1193
01:07:19.917 --> 01:07:22.708
who would bring the entire stadium
to a halt over one wrong decision?

1194
01:07:25.083 --> 01:07:26.083
Don't call me.

1195
01:07:34.917 --> 01:07:37.500
MR. DESHMUKH
LANDLORD

1196
01:07:41.583 --> 01:07:47.625
<i>The shards under my feet
Are my broken dreams</i>

1197
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:55.125
<i>Must keep them together</i>

1198
01:07:56.500 --> 01:08:01.583
<i>Life keeps pranking me</i>

1199
01:08:03.917 --> 01:08:09.000
<i>Leaves me craving every time
With no relief in sight</i>

1200
01:08:11.208 --> 01:08:18.208
<i>My luck has dried up
And no one in sight</i>

1201
01:08:18.750 --> 01:08:25.458
<i>Images remain incomplete
There's no one to add colors</i>

1202
01:08:28.333 --> 01:08:31.583
<i>I drift aimlessly one place to another</i>

1203
01:08:31.667 --> 01:08:34.167
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1204
01:08:34.333 --> 01:08:36.417
<i>No one to guide me</i>

1205
01:08:36.500 --> 01:08:38.958
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1206
01:08:39.042 --> 01:08:41.542
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1207
01:08:41.917 --> 01:08:44.042
<i>Can't find my destination</i>

1208
01:08:44.125 --> 01:08:46.333
<i>I drift aimlessly one place to another</i>

1209
01:08:46.417 --> 01:08:48.708
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1210
01:08:49.125 --> 01:08:51.417
<i>No one to guide me</i>

1211
01:08:51.500 --> 01:08:53.667
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1212
01:08:53.750 --> 01:08:56.208
<i>Drifting aimlessly</i>

1213
01:08:56.625 --> 01:09:00.500
<i>Can't find my destination</i>

1214
01:09:16.083 --> 01:09:23.083
<i>If you ever feel lost</i>

1215
01:09:23.542 --> 01:09:29.958
<i>Look through your memories</i>

1216
01:09:30.708 --> 01:09:37.708
<i>You will find the path to home</i>

1217
01:09:38.250 --> 01:09:43.625
<i>Where lies your savior</i>

1218
01:09:45.125 --> 01:09:48.417
<i>With a debt of 9000 crore rupees,
Vijay Walia has fled the country.</i>

1219
01:09:48.500 --> 01:09:50.750
<i>Down with Vijay Walia!</i>

1220
01:09:50.833 --> 01:09:53.833
<i>Out of the frying pan
and into the "Kohinoor" fire!</i>

1221
01:09:53.917 --> 01:09:57.000
<i>This is the current situation faced
by an employee of Kohinoor Airways.</i>

1222
01:09:57.125 --> 01:10:00.000
<i>Yes, you heard it right, the owner
of Kohinoor Airways, Vijay Walia,</i>

1223
01:10:00.083 --> 01:10:02.750
<i>fled the country last night.</i>

1224
01:10:02.833 --> 01:10:06.333
<i>The major question at hand is,
there was a lookout notice against him.</i>

1225
01:10:06.417 --> 01:10:07.976
<i>- So, how was he able to leave the country?</i>
- What?

1226
01:10:08.000 --> 01:10:09.476
<i>This question holds great significance
at the moment.</i>

1227
01:10:09.500 --> 01:10:10.375
<i>- Vijay Walia,</i>
- Hello?

1228
01:10:10.458 --> 01:10:11.684
<i>Who has been evading investigations</i>

1229
01:10:11.708 --> 01:10:14.125
<i>- and banks for quite some time…</i>
- What?

1230
01:10:14.208 --> 01:10:16.169
<i>- Has now fled the country!</i>
- Turn the car around.

1231
01:10:16.417 --> 01:10:18.657
<i>We haven't received our salaries
for the past six months.</i>

1232
01:10:19.042 --> 01:10:20.268
<i>Why are they giving us false hopes?</i>

1233
01:10:20.292 --> 01:10:21.976
<i>How many more lies
are they going to tell us?</i>

1234
01:10:22.000 --> 01:10:24.083
<i>When he wanted our support,
we supported him.</i>

1235
01:10:24.417 --> 01:10:27.083
<i>Only we know how
we supported our families.</i>

1236
01:10:27.458 --> 01:10:28.542
I am a single mother,

1237
01:10:29.667 --> 01:10:31.125
and I have a son…

1238
01:10:31.417 --> 01:10:32.792
Relax.

1239
01:10:32.875 --> 01:10:33.875
Let's go.

1240
01:10:35.708 --> 01:10:37.292
Komal, are you okay?

1241
01:10:38.083 --> 01:10:39.917
- What are you doing here?
- Komal…

1242
01:10:40.000 --> 01:10:41.321
Sethi ma'am, please don't bother.

1243
01:10:41.625 --> 01:10:43.106
This is not what I expected from you.

1244
01:10:43.292 --> 01:10:44.643
- Let's go.
- Komal, please hear me out.

1245
01:10:44.667 --> 01:10:45.750
What should I listen to?

1246
01:10:45.958 --> 01:10:48.583
Your excuse of how you pretended
to understand our struggles?

1247
01:10:49.292 --> 01:10:51.208
Divya, not that you care,

1248
01:10:51.792 --> 01:10:53.917
but my son was expelled
from his Montessori school.

1249
01:10:55.625 --> 01:10:58.292
I mean, I can't believe
I cried in front of you.

1250
01:10:59.958 --> 01:11:01.083
I thought we were friends.

1251
01:11:01.167 --> 01:11:02.167
Oh, please, save it.

1252
01:11:02.208 --> 01:11:04.500
Friends don't snitch on friends
to the customs officers.

1253
01:11:05.458 --> 01:11:08.625
Jasmine, I don't like you.
In fact, I've never liked you.

1254
01:11:09.042 --> 01:11:10.042
Okay?

1255
01:11:10.500 --> 01:11:13.250
But I never reported you guys.

1256
01:11:14.417 --> 01:11:16.625
Please, leave us alone.

1257
01:11:17.833 --> 01:11:19.667
And, of course,
continue your champagne party.

1258
01:11:19.750 --> 01:11:20.750
Let's go.

1259
01:11:27.958 --> 01:11:29.792
First time, I have this feeling…

1260
01:11:31.250 --> 01:11:32.750
that I am not a nice person.

1261
01:11:33.458 --> 01:11:34.750
I only feel bad about…

1262
01:11:35.542 --> 01:11:37.375
blaming Komal unnecessarily.

1263
01:11:38.208 --> 01:11:41.500
But if Komal did not tip them off,
then who did?

1264
01:11:42.042 --> 01:11:44.250
Someone knows about us, right?

1265
01:11:45.417 --> 01:11:46.667
Not just knows us…

1266
01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:50.125
but wants to see us behind bars.

1267
01:11:52.333 --> 01:11:53.333
Good God.

1268
01:11:54.458 --> 01:11:57.000
Let's hope this doesn't come back on us.

1269
01:11:58.042 --> 01:11:59.208
This is a mess!

1270
01:11:59.917 --> 01:12:03.083
But why did the constable say,

1271
01:12:04.250 --> 01:12:06.417
the tip came from an air hostess?

1272
01:12:10.125 --> 01:12:12.667
Did she say "is" or "was"?

1273
01:12:13.625 --> 01:12:16.000
Technically, she said, "was."

1274
01:12:18.250 --> 01:12:19.250
Ex-Kohinoor.

1275
01:12:19.458 --> 01:12:21.458
The informer was an air hostess like them.

1276
01:12:21.542 --> 01:12:23.583
And she knew all four of them!

1277
01:12:24.250 --> 01:12:25.250
Us three…

1278
01:12:25.917 --> 01:12:26.917
and who else?

1279
01:12:28.458 --> 01:12:29.458
Mittal?

1280
01:12:31.500 --> 01:12:33.434
Remember when I was still
an air hostess in Kohinoor

1281
01:12:33.458 --> 01:12:34.539
he would hover all over me…

1282
01:12:35.833 --> 01:12:37.000
like a bug.

1283
01:12:37.083 --> 01:12:38.404
Now, I can't get my hands on him.

1284
01:12:39.375 --> 01:12:42.083
That witch!

1285
01:12:42.375 --> 01:12:45.333
AZAD VEGETABLE MARKET

1286
01:12:45.917 --> 01:12:47.958
- I'll leave.
- Okay. See you.

1287
01:12:48.042 --> 01:12:49.042
Bye.

1288
01:12:51.208 --> 01:12:52.958
- She's leaving.
- Is she gone?

1289
01:13:02.875 --> 01:13:04.708
She turned out to be one crafty witch.

1290
01:13:05.792 --> 01:13:07.917
Hurry up with the change. Hand me the bag.

1291
01:13:08.042 --> 01:13:09.333
- Okay.
- Madam, my money?

1292
01:13:09.417 --> 01:13:11.583
- I'll send it later.
- She's making a run for it.

1293
01:13:20.375 --> 01:13:21.375
Stop.

1294
01:13:26.125 --> 01:13:27.125
Stop, witch.

1295
01:13:32.917 --> 01:13:34.292
How much for these bottle gourds?

1296
01:13:35.208 --> 01:13:36.208
Sudha.

1297
01:13:37.208 --> 01:13:38.667
What have we ever done to you?

1298
01:13:39.167 --> 01:13:41.167
Why were you trying to get us arrested?

1299
01:13:41.458 --> 01:13:42.625
Geetu, please...

1300
01:13:42.708 --> 01:13:44.667
I get it, we're not close.

1301
01:13:45.333 --> 01:13:47.375
But why snitch on your husband?

1302
01:13:50.375 --> 01:13:52.250
Because he's a dog!

1303
01:13:54.542 --> 01:13:58.292
He found a third Mrs. Mittal.
And this time, it's a white chick.

1304
01:13:59.292 --> 01:14:02.042
He spends all his money on that chick,

1305
01:14:02.125 --> 01:14:04.625
while I scrum up change
to buy bottle gourds.

1306
01:14:11.583 --> 01:14:16.000
I thought a few days behind bars
would fix his mind.

1307
01:14:17.458 --> 01:14:18.458
Sorry.

1308
01:14:19.208 --> 01:14:20.208
Sorry?

1309
01:14:20.875 --> 01:14:22.417
Your revenge game

1310
01:14:22.500 --> 01:14:24.667
could have landed us behind bars.

1311
01:14:25.167 --> 01:14:26.458
Tell me, Sudha,

1312
01:14:27.167 --> 01:14:29.625
where did Mittal get all the gold?

1313
01:14:33.125 --> 01:14:34.125
Hold on.

1314
01:14:34.583 --> 01:14:37.083
You think the gold belonged
to my husband?

1315
01:14:39.750 --> 01:14:40.750
I wish.

1316
01:14:41.583 --> 01:14:42.750
He's just a slave.

1317
01:14:43.833 --> 01:14:45.583
Dancing to his master's tune.

1318
01:14:45.917 --> 01:14:47.542
Master? What master?

1319
01:15:05.875 --> 01:15:06.917
The chairman?

1320
01:15:08.625 --> 01:15:09.833
Our chairman?

1321
01:15:10.167 --> 01:15:15.125
Geetu, Vijay Walia is a fraud.

1322
01:15:15.208 --> 01:15:17.833
For years, he's been
hauling his black money

1323
01:15:17.917 --> 01:15:19.333
to Al Burj using his airlines.

1324
01:15:19.792 --> 01:15:22.750
You mean the gold we've been transporting

1325
01:15:23.667 --> 01:15:24.667
belongs to Walia.

1326
01:15:25.333 --> 01:15:26.375
The chairman?

1327
01:15:26.708 --> 01:15:30.083
Wow! He scammed us for our salaries
and filled his bank using us.

1328
01:15:30.250 --> 01:15:31.250
Genius.

1329
01:15:31.292 --> 01:15:32.417
Our chairman?

1330
01:15:32.708 --> 01:15:36.750
And with all the money in their bank, the
master and slave are hiding in Al Burj.

1331
01:15:39.083 --> 01:15:41.958
In fact, Walia's daughter
is getting married next week.

1332
01:15:42.042 --> 01:15:44.167
How can he scam 4,000 people

1333
01:15:44.250 --> 01:15:46.208
and just leave?

1334
01:15:46.583 --> 01:15:47.833
Because he's rich, baby.

1335
01:15:48.708 --> 01:15:49.833
Look at <i>Titanic.</i>

1336
01:15:50.083 --> 01:15:51.583
The rich escaped in lifeboats.

1337
01:15:52.000 --> 01:15:53.000
And who had to drown?

1338
01:15:54.792 --> 01:15:57.542
And it was us
who put him on that boat.

1339
01:15:58.708 --> 01:15:59.583
Great.

1340
01:15:59.667 --> 01:16:01.542
What the hell have we done?

1341
01:16:02.083 --> 01:16:03.625
Yeah, true that.

1342
01:16:14.667 --> 01:16:16.750
We are a family of 4,000 members.

1343
01:16:17.250 --> 01:16:18.250
<i>We are Kohinoor.</i>

1344
01:16:18.875 --> 01:16:21.417
We'll always shine. In India.

1345
01:16:21.667 --> 01:16:23.667
My son has been expelled
from Montessori school.

1346
01:16:23.958 --> 01:16:25.039
<i>What happened to that girl,</i>

1347
01:16:25.250 --> 01:16:28.042
who would bring the entire stadium
to a halt over one wrong decision?

1348
01:16:48.083 --> 01:16:49.083
I will kill you.

1349
01:16:54.125 --> 01:16:55.208
What is this about?

1350
01:16:55.583 --> 01:16:59.083
So, Walia has been smuggling gold
for the past six years.

1351
01:16:59.167 --> 01:17:01.500
Around 10-12 kilos of gold on every trip.

1352
01:17:01.583 --> 01:17:03.518
Just one kilo of gold
is worth about 55 lakh rupees,

1353
01:17:03.542 --> 01:17:05.583
so if we make three trips a month,

1354
01:17:05.667 --> 01:17:08.042
three times twelve times six…

1355
01:17:08.417 --> 01:17:09.750
Approximately 3,000 crore rupees.

1356
01:17:10.000 --> 01:17:11.000
How much?

1357
01:17:11.083 --> 01:17:12.083
Three thousand crores.

1358
01:17:12.250 --> 01:17:14.333
That freaking idiot!

1359
01:17:14.458 --> 01:17:15.458
Exactly.

1360
01:17:15.667 --> 01:17:17.167
We just need to get it back.

1361
01:17:21.833 --> 01:17:23.083
So, you wanna rob him?

1362
01:17:25.417 --> 01:17:27.917
We're not stealing,
we're just getting even.

1363
01:17:28.667 --> 01:17:30.625
Do you have any idea
how well-connected he is?

1364
01:17:31.708 --> 01:17:33.375
We're "ants" compared to him.

1365
01:17:33.458 --> 01:17:35.958
I don't want to be an "ant" anymore.
I've had enough!

1366
01:17:36.750 --> 01:17:38.667
How long will the rich keep exploiting us?

1367
01:17:39.542 --> 01:17:41.833
Our people can't even afford
to send their kids to school,

1368
01:17:41.917 --> 01:17:44.958
and that scumbag is using our damn money
to get his daughter married.

1369
01:17:45.250 --> 01:17:46.250
Are we freaking stupid?

1370
01:17:47.500 --> 01:17:50.261
Guys, we're the ones who smuggled
that gold out of the country, right?

1371
01:17:50.625 --> 01:17:52.518
So now, we're gonna be the ones
to bring it back.

1372
01:17:52.542 --> 01:17:53.542
What say?

1373
01:17:53.750 --> 01:17:55.125
Geetu, talk some sense into her.

1374
01:17:56.000 --> 01:17:58.167
Baby, no use crying over spilled milk.

1375
01:17:58.458 --> 01:18:00.298
We can't be running around trying
to catch him.

1376
01:18:01.417 --> 01:18:03.250
But we can give it a try.

1377
01:18:07.417 --> 01:18:09.667
Geetu, you as well?

1378
01:18:09.958 --> 01:18:11.159
What else am I supposed to do?

1379
01:18:11.333 --> 01:18:13.708
Walk the streets at night?

1380
01:18:14.917 --> 01:18:16.708
I've spent my whole life living
for others.

1381
01:18:18.542 --> 01:18:19.542
Now, it's my turn.

1382
01:18:22.500 --> 01:18:23.542
If not for others,

1383
01:18:24.250 --> 01:18:25.583
I'll do it just for myself.

1384
01:18:27.417 --> 01:18:29.833
Like you say, to each her own.

1385
01:18:31.375 --> 01:18:33.000
Time to do just that.

1386
01:18:35.625 --> 01:18:36.625
Divya…

1387
01:18:38.542 --> 01:18:39.542
I'm in.

1388
01:18:41.042 --> 01:18:42.042
Okay, fine.

1389
01:18:43.708 --> 01:18:44.708
I'm out!

1390
01:18:44.833 --> 01:18:45.833
Go,

1391
01:18:46.500 --> 01:18:48.750
why should you care
about someone else's problems anyway?

1392
01:18:50.000 --> 01:18:51.000
I'm leaving, okay?

1393
01:18:51.583 --> 01:18:52.583
Then go.

1394
01:19:23.708 --> 01:19:28.333
<i>You should always have someone
in your life you can call your own.</i>

1395
01:19:46.917 --> 01:19:50.375
And how are you planning
to fund this little "project" of yours?

1396
01:19:54.250 --> 01:19:56.958
You need money to make money.

1397
01:19:58.792 --> 01:20:00.583
Time to put this fancy bag to use.

1398
01:20:03.042 --> 01:20:04.333
You may be the head girl,

1399
01:20:05.542 --> 01:20:06.750
but this is my turf.

1400
01:20:07.167 --> 01:20:08.500
And what is that?

1401
01:20:09.208 --> 01:20:10.208
Crime.

1402
01:20:12.417 --> 01:20:15.458
Wow, that was a quick change of heart.

1403
01:20:16.375 --> 01:20:18.495
I've always gotten screwed
for my own selfish reasons.

1404
01:20:19.083 --> 01:20:22.250
Thought I'd try getting screwed
for others for a change.

1405
01:20:22.958 --> 01:20:26.750
And besides, you guys wouldn't last
two days in prison without me.

1406
01:20:27.708 --> 01:20:28.708
True that.

1407
01:20:30.625 --> 01:20:32.583
But guys,
how the hell are we gonna find Walia?

1408
01:20:33.125 --> 01:20:35.458
Well, the dog always knows
where its owner is.

1409
01:21:08.792 --> 01:21:09.833
Is the address correct?

1410
01:21:10.167 --> 01:21:11.792
Yes, Sudha gave us this address.

1411
01:21:12.750 --> 01:21:14.583
Look. There's the dog.

1412
01:21:26.125 --> 01:21:29.042
<i>Gold, so much gold</i>

1413
01:21:30.583 --> 01:21:31.583
What?

1414
01:21:31.833 --> 01:21:32.833
Our gold.

1415
01:21:35.417 --> 01:21:36.917
Come on. Follow!

1416
01:21:50.042 --> 01:21:52.542
This dude is minting money.

1417
01:21:55.833 --> 01:21:57.417
Come on, let's go.

1418
01:22:11.000 --> 01:22:12.000
Stop.

1419
01:22:13.042 --> 01:22:14.208
Where are we?

1420
01:22:15.875 --> 01:22:19.792
The Palace Hotel.
5,600 acres of pure luxury.

1421
01:22:20.750 --> 01:22:22.000
Five swimming pools,

1422
01:22:22.083 --> 01:22:24.333
nine restaurants, 612 rooms.

1423
01:22:25.708 --> 01:22:26.833
All suites.

1424
01:22:27.125 --> 01:22:28.125
And the rate?

1425
01:22:28.292 --> 01:22:29.667
Way out of our budget.

1426
01:22:30.792 --> 01:22:31.792
Let's go.

1427
01:22:32.667 --> 01:22:33.667
To ask about the rate?

1428
01:22:34.542 --> 01:22:35.542
Let's go!

1429
01:22:56.583 --> 01:22:58.000
Too damn expensive. Let's bail.

1430
01:22:58.583 --> 01:22:59.583
Geetu, sit down.

1431
01:22:59.750 --> 01:23:01.583
- But…
- Waiter?

1432
01:23:04.750 --> 01:23:05.875
Hey, Mittal!

1433
01:23:13.958 --> 01:23:16.208
That idiot has completely
transformed himself overseas.

1434
01:23:18.750 --> 01:23:20.500
The suit he's rocking costs
12 lakh rupees.

1435
01:23:20.833 --> 01:23:23.958
Played the innocent fool
and swindled others' cash.

1436
01:23:30.375 --> 01:23:31.250
Let's bounce.

1437
01:23:31.333 --> 01:23:34.042
It's a hundred-dollar coffee,
I'll even slurp the damn froth.

1438
01:24:00.958 --> 01:24:04.083
Oh, so this is where he's hosting
the wedding!

1439
01:24:05.958 --> 01:24:08.000
The night of the wedding is our best bet.

1440
01:24:08.542 --> 01:24:11.022
Everyone will be downstairs,
busy with the wedding shenanigans.

1441
01:24:12.000 --> 01:24:16.000
We just gotta sneak into Walia's suite.
That's all.

1442
01:24:16.375 --> 01:24:17.417
That's all?

1443
01:24:17.625 --> 01:24:18.792
So simple, right?

1444
01:24:19.250 --> 01:24:20.976
And what about all the fancy
cameras everywhere?

1445
01:24:21.000 --> 01:24:22.280
You think nobody will notice us?

1446
01:24:23.375 --> 01:24:24.375
Oh, shit!

1447
01:24:30.333 --> 01:24:31.333
Staff.

1448
01:24:31.667 --> 01:24:33.375
Nobody notices the staff.

1449
01:24:33.458 --> 01:24:35.708
We have to get a job here.

1450
01:24:36.000 --> 01:24:37.000
Staff?

1451
01:24:40.000 --> 01:24:41.000
Here?

1452
01:24:41.458 --> 01:24:42.779
And how the hell will we do that?

1453
01:24:44.542 --> 01:24:46.559
Where's Sapna?
I haven't been able to reach her for days.

1454
01:24:46.583 --> 01:24:49.833
Come on! She got a gig at a hotel
in the Middle East.

1455
01:24:49.917 --> 01:24:51.708
<i>She left.</i>

1456
01:24:57.458 --> 01:24:58.750
I'm sorry, Geetu.

1457
01:24:59.250 --> 01:25:00.792
I just couldn't take it anymore.

1458
01:25:02.667 --> 01:25:03.958
If I were in your shoes,

1459
01:25:04.833 --> 01:25:06.500
I would've left him a while ago.

1460
01:25:15.625 --> 01:25:18.583
Think of me as the hotel's HR manager.

1461
01:25:19.083 --> 01:25:21.250
What job do you want?

1462
01:25:21.875 --> 01:25:22.875
Plumber.

1463
01:25:23.000 --> 01:25:24.167
Security guard.

1464
01:25:24.250 --> 01:25:25.083
Chef.

1465
01:25:25.167 --> 01:25:27.125
Cleaner. Janitor.

1466
01:25:27.333 --> 01:25:28.458
Gardner.

1467
01:25:28.625 --> 01:25:29.625
Laundry.

1468
01:25:29.958 --> 01:25:30.958
Massage.

1469
01:25:31.167 --> 01:25:32.167
House-keeping.

1470
01:25:35.208 --> 01:25:36.208
Two thousand.

1471
01:25:36.292 --> 01:25:37.292
Rupees?

1472
01:25:38.917 --> 01:25:39.917
Dollars?!

1473
01:25:42.417 --> 01:25:44.750
<i>A very good evening
to the new housekeeping team.</i>

1474
01:25:44.833 --> 01:25:45.833
<i>Welcome aboard.</i>

1475
01:25:45.958 --> 01:25:48.208
We've got 540 total guests.

1476
01:25:48.542 --> 01:25:50.382
<i>Every evening,
right before we start our shift,</i>

1477
01:25:50.458 --> 01:25:52.167
<i>we have a half-hour briefing.</i>

1478
01:25:52.625 --> 01:25:54.417
<i>Nobody is on the floor during that time.</i>

1479
01:25:54.875 --> 01:25:56.250
Now, that's our window.

1480
01:25:56.458 --> 01:25:57.667
We have a teeny-weeny problem.

1481
01:25:58.042 --> 01:26:00.292
There are 18 cameras
from Walia's suite to the elevator

1482
01:26:00.375 --> 01:26:02.958
and 104 cameras from the elevator
to the service exit.

1483
01:26:03.042 --> 01:26:05.458
Nobody notices the staff
until something goes missing.

1484
01:26:06.042 --> 01:26:08.393
So, the cops will definitely look
at those video recordings.

1485
01:26:08.417 --> 01:26:10.833
And my face will be plastered
on every "wanted" poster.

1486
01:26:11.375 --> 01:26:12.456
What the hell do we do now?

1487
01:26:17.750 --> 01:26:18.917
I quit doing all that stuff.

1488
01:26:19.000 --> 01:26:20.000
Chintu!

1489
01:26:20.958 --> 01:26:23.208
Chintu, you're my brother, right?

1490
01:26:23.750 --> 01:26:26.625
Come on, do it for me, pretty please.

1491
01:26:27.292 --> 01:26:28.612
Fine, enough with the sweet talk.

1492
01:26:29.167 --> 01:26:31.625
I want an iPhone… 18.

1493
01:26:31.875 --> 01:26:33.833
18? That thing isn't even released yet.

1494
01:26:34.708 --> 01:26:35.708
Hello?

1495
01:26:37.000 --> 01:26:38.000
Idiot.

1496
01:26:39.167 --> 01:26:42.125
<i>The hotel's security camera feed
goes straight into the server room.</i>

1497
01:26:42.208 --> 01:26:45.169
<i>All the footage, except for the live
stuff, gets saved onto the hard drive.</i>

1498
01:26:45.625 --> 01:26:47.458
<i>We'll have to corrupt the hard drive.</i>

1499
01:27:19.208 --> 01:27:22.000
Shaftab Karimi.

1500
01:27:22.375 --> 01:27:23.375
Hi, cutie.

1501
01:27:27.708 --> 01:27:30.292
Oh! <i>Sharraya!</i>

1502
01:27:30.625 --> 01:27:32.625
Every hotel has its own system.

1503
01:27:33.167 --> 01:27:35.333
The dental kit, conditioner…

1504
01:27:36.458 --> 01:27:41.083
Hey, only the guests get access
to the presidential suite.

1505
01:27:41.625 --> 01:27:43.125
Observe and study.

1506
01:27:46.583 --> 01:27:47.583
Housekeeping.

1507
01:27:48.625 --> 01:27:49.625
Hurry up!

1508
